,{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"reading.complex_classification\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The question concerns the suitability obligation following classification when no solicitation or recommendation occurs. The program encodes classification grounds, not the resulting sales obligations. Its narrative discussion of suitability does not encode this question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"For 26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence, operative SFC designation status remains unknown; neither classification nor absence of both grounds is established.\",\"Temporal applicability and the applicable exposure measurement basis remain conditional as stated in the candidate; the stipulated percentages do not independently resolve the circular's general timing or measurement uncertainties.\"]}"}}
