ification route applies.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.241bdcebd49036f3d3ad3a42\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"Suitability obligations following classification are distinct from the two classification routes encoded by this control. The program does not evaluate sales requirements or the effect of absence of solicitation or recommendation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"Neither candidate encodes the threshold route alone as its result; a shared true outcome at exactly 50% does not establish precise question alignment.\",\"The below-threshold scenario leaves operative designation unknown, and the candidates do not resolve historical classification persistence.\",\"Both candidates exclude LAFs from their scope and do not encode the suitability requirement.\"]}"}}
