{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"mappings\":[{\"alignment\":\"SAME_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"sfc_authorised_public_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The case expressly states that the fund is SFC-authorised and in scope for public offering.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The case expressly states that the fund is not a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav\",\"rationale\":\"Exactly 50% satisfies the inclusive 50% or more threshold.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The case does not state whether the SFC separately made a case-by-case designation; that fact is not needed because the threshold route is satisfied.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the express inclusive 50% threshold classifies the in-scope fund as complex. The candidate directly evaluates that classification trigger, and the exposure fact is true at exactly 50%.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"},{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"sfc_authorised_public_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The case states that this is the same type of in-scope fund as the preceding scenario.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The case states that this is the same type of in-scope fund, so it is not an excluded LAF.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav\",\"rationale\":\"Exposure of 49.9% is below the inclusive 50% threshold.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The case provides no evidence establishing whether an applicable SFC case-by-case designation exists.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The question asks for the negation of the candidate's classification result. Because designation status is unknown, the fund is not definitely non-complex under this selected trigger.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The candidate is scoped to an SFC-authorised public fund that is not a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund. This case is an excluded LAF, so the unchanged program makes no classification decision for it; the case question is therefore not encoded by the candidate.\",\"source_evidence\":[]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.68f8e39cf8e43c95a1e0890d\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The candidate evaluates whether the classification trigger is satisfied. The case asks about a downstream suitability requirement after classification, including the effect of no solicitation or recommendation, which is a different question.\",\"source_evidence\":[]},{\"alignment\":\"SAME_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"public_sfc_authorised\",\"rationale\":\"The case expressly states that the fund is SFC-authorised and in scope for public offering.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The case expressly states that the fund is not a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav\",\"rationale\":\"Exactly 50% satisfies the inclusive 50% or more threshold.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The case does not state whether the SFC separately made a case-by-case designation; that fact is unnecessary because the threshold route is satisfied.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The case directly asks whether the express 50% threshold classifies the in-scope fund as complex, matching the candidate's Boolean classification trigger.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6 in this regard.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"},{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"public_sfc_authorised\",\"rationale\":\"The case states that this is the same type of in-scope fund as the preceding scenario.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The case states that this is the same type of in-scope fund, so it is not an excluded LAF.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav\",\"rationale\":\"Exposure of 49.9% is below the inclusive 50% threshold.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The case provides no evidence establishing whether an operative SFC designation exists.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The question asks whether the fund is definitely non-complex, the negation of the candidate's classification result. Unknown designation evidence prevents a definite negative conclusion.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The candidate scope excludes listed closed-ended alternative asset funds, so it does not answer whether this LAF is classified under the circular.\",\"source_evidence\":[]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about a downstream suitability requirement for an already classified complex fund. The candidate only determines whether the classification trigger is satisfied and does not encode that sales-duty question.\",\"source_evidence\":[]}],\"unresolved\":[\"The LAF case is outside both candidates' stated scope, so neither candidate answers whether the circular itself establishes a classification for that vehicle.\",\"The no-solicitation case concerns downstream suitability obligations, which are not encoded by either classification-trigger formalization.\"]}"}}
