{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"mappings\":[{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the express threshold itself classifies the fund. The unchanged program tests the disjunction of threshold satisfaction and an applicable SFC designation. A particular classification trigger is a different question from that combined predicate, even when their answers coincide on the stipulated scenario.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about the threshold route specifically. The unchanged program answers whether either of two classification routes applies. Its threshold input is the relevant subcondition, but that subcondition is not the program's complete Boolean question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\",\"The question about non-complex status under this circular is read as asking whether both selected classification routes are absent at the assessment occasion; it does not ask about other instruments or persistence of earlier classification.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"sfc_authorised_public_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario expressly stipulates an in-scope fund of the same authorised type.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario stipulates the same in-scope, non-LAF type of fund.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"direct_exposure\",\"rationale\":\"Only an aggregate exposure percentage is supplied; no separate direct exposure amount is stipulated.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"indirect_exposure\",\"rationale\":\"Only an aggregate exposure percentage is supplied; no separate indirect exposure amount is stipulated.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"nav\",\"rationale\":\"No exact NAV amount in a common valuation unit is supplied. A percentage does not establish an integer NAV value.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"applicable_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario explicitly leaves whether an applicable SFC designation exists unestablished. Missing evidence cannot be bound as false.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"Under the stated reading, non-complex status is the negation of the combined classification predicate. The designation remains unknown, so definite absence of classification is not established. The stipulated 49.9% also cannot supply the separate exact monetary inputs required by this unchanged program.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\",\"The question about non-complex status under this circular is read as asking whether both selected classification routes are absent at the assessment occasion; it does not ask about other instruments or persistence of earlier classification.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"authorised_public_hk\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario expressly stipulates an in-scope fund of the same authorised type.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario stipulates the same in-scope, non-LAF type of fund.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_50_percent\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated aggregate exposure is 49.9% of NAV, below 50%. The factual stipulation is accepted as supplied.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario explicitly states that no evidence establishes whether SFC made a designation; neither existence nor absence is established.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"Under the stated reading, the question asks for the negation of the selected classification predicate. The threshold route is absent, but the designation route remains unknown. Neither the predicate nor its negation is established; uncertainty must not be converted into a finding of non-complex status.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether this circular establishes classification for an excluded vehicle. That is a scope question. The program supplies a classification result only within scope; failure of scope is not a false classification result or its Boolean negation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The question concerns applicability of the circular to a LAF. The scope condition excludes LAFs, while the result concerns classification routes for an in-scope fund. A scope exclusion does not answer the result predicate as false.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about the suitability requirement following an established classification. The program tests classification routes and does not encode the resulting sale requirement or the relevance of solicitation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The program determines whether selected classification routes apply. The case instead asks whether suitability is required for a sale without solicitation or recommendation after classification has already occurred. That downstream obligation is unencoded.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"The below-threshold scenario leaves the existence of an applicable SFC designation unknown for both candidates.\",\"The numeric candidate cannot recover separate direct exposure, indirect exposure and exact NAV amounts from the stipulated aggregate percentage without inventing inputs.\",\"The negated mappings use the expressly stated assessment-occasion reading. A broader question about continuing classification after a previous threshold crossing is not encoded by either program.\"]}"}}
