vate market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\",\"Non-complex under this circular is read as absence of both selected classification routes; definiteness requires established facts, not treating missing evidence as false.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"authorised_public_hk\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario expressly stipulates an in-scope fund of the same authorised type.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated in-scope fund is not within the LAF exclusion.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_50_percent\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated aggregate exposure is 49.9% of NAV, below 50%.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"No evidence establishes whether a case-specific designation exists; absence of evidence does not establish false.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The case asks for the negation of the selected classification condition. The threshold route is false, but the designation route remains unknown, so neither the predicate nor its negation is established.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_