r its application without solicitation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The program determines whether a classification route applies. It does not answer whether suitability remains required for a sale without solicitation or recommendation. Established complex classification cannot be substituted for evidence of either particular classification route.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"For the below-threshold case, an operative SFC designation remains unknown for both candidates.\",\"The numerical candidate requires exact direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV amounts that the below-threshold scenario does not supply; its stipulated aggregate percentage cannot be preserved through invented integer assignments.\"]}"}}
