 satisfy every condition in the candidate's eligibility predicate, so the candidate answers the same Boolean question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"(ii)       Material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions – Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"},{\"quote\":\"The streamlined measures set out in the relevant FAQs will take effect on 28 November 2025 (Effective Date).\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u9.1696\"},{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ea4d19630f8cab09065b1909\",\"case_id\":\"25ec66.complex.change\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the stated removal unconditionally covers the change. The candidate encodes conditional eligibility that expressly excludes novel or complex features, so it does not encode the unconditional-coverage question or its direct negation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"(ii)       Material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions – Removing the SFC’s requirement on prior approval for material changes in investment objectives, policies and restrictions which comply with the fund’s home jurisdiction requirements, except for changes that involve novel or complex product features and/or which may have local policy implications.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u5.840\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ea4d19630f8cab09065b1909\",\"case_id\":\"25ec66.pending.application\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the existing approval or authorisation process continues for a pending application. The candidate concerns eligibility for new approval relief and treats a legacy pending application as an exclusion; it does not encode the separate process-continuation proposition or its negation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Existing applications received by the SFC before the Effective Date for which no approval or authorisation has been granted will be processed by the SFC in accordance with the existing approval or authorisation process.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u10.1809\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.ea4d19630f8cab09065b1909\",\"case_id\":\"25ec66.uk.ucits\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether a UK-authorised UK UCITS scheme is included in the circular's definition of UCITS funds. The candidate's Boolean predicate assumes scope but does not encode the definitional inclusion question itself or its negation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For this circular, UCITS funds means (i) Undertakings for Collective Investment in Transferable Securities (UCITS) domiciled in France, Luxembourg, Ireland and the Netherlands, and (ii) collective investment schemes domiciled in the United Kingdom authorised as UK UCITS.\",\"unit_id\":\"d97b56331f41a.u17.2556\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[]}"}}
